quick_facts: Discovered radioactivity in 1896 — via a cloudy-week accident
quick_facts: Uranium salts fogged plates with no sunlight needed
quick_facts: Shared the 1903 Nobel Prize in Physics with the Curies
quick_facts: The becquerel (Bq) unit honors him
